                                         {
                                             "text":  "Faster Turnaround Time : Quick response to your staffing needs with minimal lead time.",
                                             "bold":  [

                                                      ]
                                         },
                                         {
                                             "text":  "End-to-End Support : From sourcing and onboarding to compliance and retention, we handle it all.",
